# Every service deploys from the repository root, because each project's own root directory
# resolves from there. Without this file Vercel falls back to .gitignore, which does not exclude
# the native app checkouts: a release from a laptop would upload a gigabyte of iOS build products
# that CI, with a clean checkout, never has. This keeps both uploads identical.
#
# It replaces .gitignore for uploads, so everything .gitignore excludes is repeated here.
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.next
.turbo
coverage
DerivedData
dist
node_modules
playwright-report
test-results
results.sarif
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata
.terraform/
*.tfplan
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.tfbackend
!*.tfbackend.example
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
supabase/.env
*.log
.vercel
.live-gate/
live-gate-api.json

# Nothing a serverless function needs, and the largest things in a working copy.
.git
apps/ios
apps/mobile
